  "notes": [
    "Job read is restricted to permitted domain/purpose or requesting member, never all organization jobs just because a code exists.",
    "Manager cannot change owner roles, billing or staff grants. Delegation is the intersection of caller rights and scope.",
    "Team scope is a custom approved office-based grant; agent defaults remain own.",
    "Owner can delegate ordinary codes but not staff/guard capabilities. Publish/send/export remain explicit actions.",
    "Self capabilities are own only. Public visitor and platform staff use separate policy contexts."
  ]
